# alert-level-yellow-instructions = Crewmembers are advised to stay away from the threat, and stay in their workplaces if necessary.
alert-level-yellow-announcement = An epidemiological threat has been detected. Masks or internals are recommended.
alert-level-yellow-instructions = Epidemiological threat. Masks or internals are recommended. Report symptoms to a medical center.
alert-level-yellow-start = Attention all contractors! Transition to pink code has begun. Outbreaks of an unknown virus have been recorded in the Colossus sector.
alert-level-yellow-end = Transition complete. Pink code is in effect. Anyone with illness, dizziness, coughing or other symptoms should report to a medical center.

